{"c":[{"name":"20261016T022227Z-ccb5b17bf805c62a","text":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo (parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName). Dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task; children with a spawn id join before the zip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T195949Z-b101405aa74423ff","text":"Marketplace plugin copies (Claude and Cursor caches) contain .git and Makefile: neither marks a dev checkout. shim rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign shims and unidentified files stay untouched.","type":"note"}]}
